{"seq":26,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-rr-l3-mu-v04-dev/rr-09-l3-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T23:33:20.612Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4632d6f7b2f68e96bc2a01dc175585bdb3a5e27d16fb0513bf5672c9b1d69591","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"Here's what I can find in the channels and files you have access to:\n\nWest yard Door 2 double-booking: Tobias mentioned it in #central-random on Oct 13. He said West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk, and that he flagged it to support on ticket #8841. He brought it up while checking the Plains depots for what Hollis called \"Tobias's dealer account.\" Nothing names that account as Marrow Fieldworks, so check with Tobias that it's the same customer before you add it to the file. I didn't see any update after that.\n\nDriver SMS prompt glitch on overflow lots: I found nothing on this anywhere you can see.\n\nAlso, there are no account files for Marrow Fieldworks in the share. The Marrow material I found is about Marrow Agrisupply, a separate account (PD-4821, the Pine Crossing shift issue), so I left it out. If the SMS issue came up in a ticket or email thread, Tobias or support would be the people to ask.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792591200.000130","thread_ts":"1792591200.000129"}}
